window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I never belonged until I was chosen by an alpha, but our love is forbidden…</b></p> <p>Volunteering was supposed to be a way to honor my grandmother's memory, not a place to meet hot guys. But that's exactly what happens when Chael lands in my life due to a string of disappearances and deaths at the nursing home I volunteer at.</p> <p>There's something different about the private investigator that goes beyond his breathtaking good looks. The way he's behaving around me, anyone would think it's his job to protect me rather than solve the case.</p> <p>When I become a target, I discover that Chael's far more than a private investigator. He's a wolf shifter who is the alpha of his pack. And he believes I'm his mate.</p> <p>If I accept Chael, I'll need to have the courage to become an alpha queen. But no matter how strong my feelings are for Chael, it's forbidden for humans and shifters to be together. And it's becoming dangerously clear that someone will go to any length to keep us apart…</p>"; 
